  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Fills a real gap in the MONAI ecosystem — bridges trained model development to clinical production via DICOM/FHIR gateway, workflow orchestration, and standardised app packaging. The Informatics Gateway's DICOM and FHIR integration is directly relevant for hospital deployments. Apache 2.0, part of Project-MONAI (NVIDIA-backed). Marked Assess due to pre-release versioning (v0.6.1), low community traction (117 stars), and explicit production caution in release notes.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
